结果已写入 result.txt。
── 步骤轨迹 ──
  [step 0] read_file({'path': 'data.txt'}) -> apple banana apple cherry apple grape apple lemon apple mang
  [step 1] run_python({'code': 'from collections import Counter\ntext = open(\'data.txt\').read()\nwords = text.split()\nc = Counter(words)\ntop = c.most_common(1)[0]\nresult = f"出现最多的词: {top[0]}, 次数: {top[1]}\\n\\n完整词频:\\n" + "\\n".join(f"{w}: {n}" for w, n in c.most_common())\nopen(\'result.txt\',\'w\').write(result)\nprint(result)'}) -> 出现最多的词: apple, 次数: 10

